    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "ECONOMY CLASS",
      "dinner SEOUL TO SINGAPORE\ndinner SEOUL TO SINGAPORE\ninternational selection\nappetiser\nindian selection\nappetiser\nMarinated shrimp and cucumber salad with garlic\ndressing\nKabuli kishti\nChick peas in tamarind\nmain course\nmain course\nChicken \"Cacciatore\" stew, sauteed vegetables\nand pasta\nor\nBeef with Korean bulgogi sauce, stir fried\nvegetable and steamed rice\nAloo mattar, paneer makhani and nariyal chawal\nCurried potatoes-peas, cottage cheese in butter, coconut rice,\ncurd and pickles\ndessert\nhot beverages\nIce cream\ncheese\nCoffee - Tea\nCheese and crackers\ndessert\nIce cream\nfrom the bakery\nRoll and butter\nhot beverages\nCoffee - Tea\nGreen tea\nPlease accept our apologies if your choice of meal is not available\nPlease accept our apologies if your choice of meal is not available\nSQ15QC SFO-ICN-SIN (LX/SN1/LMX/DX) 6-2.1 05-06 EY\nSQ15QC SFO-ICN-SIN (LX/SN1/LMX/DX) 6-2.1 05-06 EY"
